any length of time without my stash in direct sight.

>> Any advantage to using a chest vs. a large box?
>
>Not that I know of. You may even use a bag.

There is an advantage to using an ice chest though. Cubes will ingest
bags/boxes/chests and sit on the contents. Ice chests are indestructable by
Cubes, so you don't have to find a new container for your stash (and have
to cart that crap around again).

Personally, I prefer bags, since they are a lot lighter than boxes/chests
and can be put directly into a BoH, it makes moving your stash level a
*hell* of a lot easier. Problem is that bags of anything-but-tricks are
really rare for me. 

